cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Sealed-window TPB replication package (Paper 1A)"
message: "If you use this code or analytic file, please cite the article and this release."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE_ORG/paper1a-sealed-window-tpb"
abstract: >
  Replication package for Paper 1A: a sealed-window test of the theory of
  planned behaviour on Inside Airbnb reviews. Includes analysis code, tables,
  figures, and a text-free analytic sample (N = 706,921) with re-hashed IDs.
keywords:
  - theory of planned behaviour
  - revisit intention
  - online reviews
  - double machine learning
  - hospitality
authors:
